cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, cite this release and the scientific sources linked from the thermochemistry table."
title: "Curated Gibbs Free Energies for Aqueous Metal Species and Crystalline Solids"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Johansen"
    given-names: "Frederik Lizak"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrederikLizakJohansen/pourbase"
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - Gibbs energy of formation
  - thermochemistry
  - Pourbaix diagrams
  - Materials Project
  - density functional theory
  - aqueous ions
abstract: >-
  A source-backed database of 460 aqueous, solid, liquid, and gas species across 74
  supported elemental systems. Version 1.0 provides recommended thermochemistry, retained reported
  values, source references, explicit evidence gaps, phase identities, selected Materials Project
  data, and an experimental Pourbaix calculation package at 298.15 K and 1 bar.
